atom_style granular
atom_modify map array
boundary f f f
newton off
communicate single vel yes
units si
region dom block -0.004 0.004 -0.004 0.004 -0.004 0.004 units box
create_box 1 dom
neighbor 0.0005 bin
neigh_modify delay 0
fix p1 all property/global youngsModulus peratomtype 100000000.0
fix p2 all property/global poissonsRatio peratomtype 0.3
fix p3 all property/global coefficientRestitution peratomtypepair 1 0.5
fix p4 all property/global coefficientFriction peratomtypepair 1 0.5
fix p5 all property/global surfaceLiquidContentInitial scalar 0.01
fix p6 all property/global minSeparationDistanceRatio scalar 1.001
fix p7 all property/global maxSeparationDistanceRatio scalar 1.5
fix p8 all property/global fluidViscosity scalar 1e-12
fix p9 all property/global contactAngle peratomtype 0.0
fix p10 all property/global liquidSurfaceTension scalar 0.072
pair_style gran model hertz tangential history cohesion easo/capillary/viscous 
pair_coeff * *
create_atoms 1 single 0 0 0 units box
create_atoms 1 single 0.0020019999999999999 0 0 units box
set atom * diameter 0.002 density 2500.0
timestep 1e-7
fix integr all move linear 0 0 0
variable fx1 equal fx[1]
thermo_style custom step v_fx1
thermo_modify format float %.17g norm no
thermo 1
run 3
